<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\death_sound3.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>A nata... and a mace...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Those are weapons often used in Arata, but using them both at the same time...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For hunting animals, that's far too inefficient.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Do the other people use the nata and mace too?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No way! Only me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> can do that! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Everybody else uses guns anyway. </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> said to hunt with the nata and mace!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE> had trained them like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In that moment, I found myself picturing the worst possible plan on the part of <STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE>.<PG>
What if he had talked <STYLE ID="3">Chiga-nee</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE> into it with some excuse and made them take part in the curse-killings?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What if he'd had them use the nata and mace all the time so they could practice killing people?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
These large weapons are well suited to killing people.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hunting guns make noise, so these are also less likely to be noticed by anyone nearby.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, are you okay? You look pale."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? Ah, no..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> hadn't noticed yet.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE> has learned more than enough killing techniques.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The <STYLE ID="2">10-year-old girl</STYLE> right in front of me now could even attack us on a single word from <STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"K-</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... So, the person who killed your </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">do you hate them...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hmm, yeah. If I ever find the culprit...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\黒塗り.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
